    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40161" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quīnĭo</span></b> ,
		ōnis, m.
		quini, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the number five</i>, <i>a pentad</i>
			(post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quinionem filiorum eniti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Anim. 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">voluminum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 46</span></i>
			. —Esp. at dice, <i>a five</i>, <i>a cinque</i>, <i><span class="en">Isid. Orig.
				18, 65</span></i>.</div>
